# [Your Name] — Technology Modernization Leader

With 26 years in technology — including 10 years within the ABC Insurance ecosystem — I combine deep ABC Insurance institutional knowledge, IBM product expertise, and hands-on architecture to turn complex legacy modernization challenges into practical, scalable, cloud-native solutions.

## 1. I Know the ABC Insurance Technology Ecosystem — and Connect the Dots

I understand how application and infrastructure assets are discovered, how they relate to one another, and where critical ownership, dependency, and governance information resides across disparate enterprise sources — turning fragmented data into actionable intelligence for asset discovery, dependency mapping, modernization planning, and technology rationalization.

Deep working knowledge of ABC Insurance's asset discovery ecosystem: CMDB, ServiceNow, ITADA, DevOps, CDRS, REG, IaaS DB, NLyte, SOLMA, WAS, CaaS, Dynatrace, Splunk, and legacy systems such as TAG and TP2.

## 2. I Turn Engineering Challenges into Enterprise Accelerators

I identify recurring engineering challenges and architect reusable solutions that deliver value across hundreds of teams:

- **Migration Assistant** — enabled **600+ teams** with Spring Boot upgrades, ROSA migrations, and Entra enablement, saving **10,000+ hours** of manual effort
- **TP2 Discovery & Decommission Tools** — automated decommissioning of **800+ applications**, including cleanup of spaces, organizations, and routes across production and non-production environments
- **Enterprise Asset Intelligence** — helped architect a Data Lake integrating **25+ ABC Insurance data sources** to discover and correlate servers, applications, databases, ownership, and governance information into a consolidated enterprise view
- **MSAT** — evolved an enterprise migration tracking platform with Kanban-based migration phase management, GenAI-powered natural-language search, on-demand dashboard generation, and conversational access to migration data

## 3. I Bring Deep IBM Expertise to ABC Insurance Modernization

As a long-time IBMer and certified expert in IBM middleware — IBM MQ, Db2, and WebSphere Application Server — I bring specialized knowledge of platforms heavily used across ABC Insurance and currently undergoing modernization. I have led multiple Entra enablement patterns and exemplars for IBM MQ, and contributed to key architecture and engineering design decisions.

Hands-on modernization experience: PCF-to-ROSA migrations, OpenShift enablement, VMware-to-OpenShift Virtualization, Spring Boot modernization, and MQ modernization. I played a key role in the initial ROSA setup and **authored the majority of the initial ROSA Cookbook**, helping application teams adopt and consume the platform.

## 4. I Architect and Build — Not Just Recommend

A hands-on architect who takes solutions from concept to production. Technical breadth spans Java, Spring Boot, Python, React, AWS, OpenShift/ROSA, Kubernetes, microservices, data engineering, DevOps, GitOps, and enterprise integration. I define architecture, evaluate alternatives, build prototypes, and drive solutions through production implementation.

I actively apply GenAI, LLMs, RAG, AI agents, and MCP to real engineering challenges — making enterprise data more accessible and simplifying discovery, reporting, automation, and modernization workflows.

**Bottom line:** ABC Insurance institutional knowledge + deep IBM expertise + hands-on engineering = legacy modernization delivered, not just recommended.

